# 🚀 AWS Serverless Task Management API

A serverless REST API built using AWS Lambda, API Gateway, and DynamoDB to manage tasks without provisioning or managing servers.

---

## 📌 Project Overview

This project demonstrates how to build a scalable serverless application on AWS.

The API allows users to:

-  Create a task
-  Retrieve all tasks
-  Update task status
-  Delete a task

The entire backend is powered by managed AWS services.

---

## Architecture

```
Client (Postman)
        │
        ▼
API Gateway
        │
        ▼
AWS Lambda
        │
        ▼
Amazon DynamoDB
```

